# wq#1652 — unified RAM-actuator protect-list (cmdline regexes, one per line).
# A process whose full cmdline matches ANY line here is never killed by a RAM
# actuator (rosco, node-killer generic sweeps, healer RAM-crit, future
# ram-actuator). Regexes, not bare names: rosco's name-allowlist left bash
# wrappers unprotected — a 7-day-old fworker wrapper was fair game.
# Lines starting with # are comments.
fworker\.py
/home/lumen/bin/lumen-run
/home/lumen/bin/lumen-pr
claude-code
/usr/local/bin/claude
/home/lumen/foreman/harness/
systemd-run .*cloudflared
/home/lumen/bin/cfd-actuator
/home/lumen/bin/holddown
/home/lumen/bin/slock
